{"title":"Robert C. Byrd Honors Scholarship Program","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>High school graduates accepted for enrollment in an institution of high education and with outstanding academic achievements should apply in their home state. Students attending military academies are ineligible.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Robert_C._Byrd_Honors_Scholarship_Program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>graduated high school or received GED</li>\n<li>be a legal resident of the state</li>\n<li>be a U.S. citizen, permanent resident, or national of the U.S.</li>\n<li>has applied or been accepted for enrollment at an institution of higher education</li>\n<li>not ineligible to receive assistance as a result of default on a Federal student loan or other obligation</li>\n<li>file, with the school that he or she plans to attend, a Statement of Selective Service Registration Status.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Amount\">Amount</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Robert_C._Byrd_Honors_Scholarship_Program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Amount\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Average award per scholar: $1,500\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>For more information, check out the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www2.ed.gov/programs/iduesbyrd/index.html\">website</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Robert_C._Byrd_Honors_Scholarship_Program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=National_scholarships\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"National scholarships\">National scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105417\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8850:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018105417 and revision id 227961. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}